{
 "priority": 7,
 "source_bins": [
  "talk.bin"
 ],
 "strings": {
  "Waaaah! Black! White! Please, have mercy!": "",
  "Huh? What's with this fool?": "",
  "Eh, c'mon bro, leave him be. He'll probably puke on you.": "",
  "Yeah, fuck that. Watch where you're goin' next time, dumbass!": "",
  "(Oh... I guess they weren't the calamity. Now even I'm starting to feel paranoid.)": "",
  "(A dog? No way that's it... Is it?)": "",
  "Aghh! That dog is black and white! Ahhh! Be a good boy, don't bite me!": "",
  "Ahhhhhhhh! A black and white car! Please don't run me over!": "",
  "(He's still okay... But maybe that's being generous...)": "",
  "Hm? Isn't this where...": "",
  "Meguro-san. What are you doing here?": "",
  "This is all your fault!": "",
  "I can't even work anymore because of you!": "",
  "I'm a zookeeper, you know! I take care of pandas!": "",
  "Ah. I didn't expect to be right about the panda, but I'll take it.": "",
  "Ever since you saw this little \"calamity,\" I can't even look at my pandas! Hell, I can hardly walk down the street!": "",
  "I requested to be given a different enclosure, and you know what they gave me!? Zebras! Fuckin' zebras!": "",
  "I'm afraid my prophecies are absolute, Meguro-san. Destiny is immutable.": "",
  "E-Exactly. Everything happens exactly as you predict it, right!?": "",
  "That means your prophecies are the cause! It's all your fault!": "",
  "That is patently false. All I'm doing is glimpsing into an inevitable future.": "",
  "Y-You're wrong!": "",
  "No, Meguro-san. And I can sense your calamity drawing nearer. I'd advise caution, now.": "",
  "Sh-Shut up!": "",
  "Ah... What are you doing?": "",
  "It's simple! I'm ending the source of my calamities!": "",
  "A black jacket and a white shirt... You too!?": "",
  "Oh. Yeah, huh.": "",
  "Goddammit! I'll kill you both!": "",
  "(Don't tell me I'm the black and white calamity...)": "",
  "Fuck!": "",
  "Oh, hey! Police cars... are black and white.": "",
  "I think that may be the answer. Fate works in mysterious ways, doesn't it?": "",
  "(He brought it upon himself, yet her prophecy was spot on...)": "",
  "Would you say you've become a believer, Yagami-san?": "",
  "I don't know if I'd go that far. After all, you couldn't predict that you were going to be attacked, right?": "",
  "Or maybe you can sense everyone's calamities but your own?": "",
  "Perhaps. As mysterious as fate may be, it also has a dark sense of humor.": "",
  "Well, as long you don't predict the apocalypse of humanity, I guess I'll look forward to the next paying calamity?": "",
  "...And with that, here is your fee.": "",
  "Thanks. Here's to averting more disasters together.": "",
  "Oh, sorry. I'm kind of busy right now.": "",
  "I see. That's a shame.": "",
  "There may still be time, so just let me know if you decide to be altruistic.": "",
  "Yagami-san. Will you accept my request?": "",
  "(Well, guess I'd better get going...)": "",
  "Uh... like what?": "",
  "Hm? And what would that be?": "",
  "N-No, of course I do! In fact, I'm doing the thing right now!": "",
  "Oh, before you go! There's something I need to serve you!": "",
  "I have to, uh, serve you something... that... comes at the end of the meal...?": "",
  "You know. Every sushi restaurant serves it at the end. That thing!": "",
  "C'monnnn, I'm sure you know what it is! Just let me know and I'll be happy to get it for you!": "",
  "Oh? Like what?": "",
  "What thing?": "",
  "Uh... yeah! Hand towel, coming right up!": "",
  "(Don't tell me... This guy doesn't know what to serve, so he's trying to coax the answer out of me?)": "",
  "Uh... sure! Boss, I need some ginger for this fine gentleman!": "",
  "(Hmm. But what would a sushi restaurant serve at the end of the meal?)": "",
  "Oh, I see! Boss, the customer's asking for the restroom key!": "",
  "Are you talking about a hand towel?": "",
  "Are you talking about ginger?": "",
  "Waaaaaaaahhhh! I'm sorry, I'm sorry!": "",
  "Y-Yes sir!": "",
  "...Sorry you had to cover for me just now.": "",
  "Are you talking about the restroom key?": "",
  "Now, now. I'm the one who told him the wrong answer. Can't you go a little easy on him?": "",
  "Ah... You know what, that totally makes sense!": "",
  "I think I know what you're talking about. It's green tea, right?": "",
  "Welp, here's your tea!": "",
  "It's generally served last because it washes away the fish taste from the mouth.": "",
  "Phew... Whenever I ask the chef something, he always gets super upset, so... thanks for helping me out.": "",
  "Don't worry about it.": "",
  "Huh? Bean juice?": "",
  "H-Hey, why do you keep asking me? I'm your customer, man.": "",
  "N-No, of course not! In fact, I'm restocking it right now!": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san! Please wait! Do you know what he means by <font_kind=yakuza_italic>bean juice</font_kind>?": "",
  "But... if I ask anyone else, they always get all mad at me, so...": "",
  "Sheesh, some chef you are. How did you even get hired?": "",
  "That's not what's important, Yagami-san! Please, just tell me: what does he mean by \"bean juice\"?": "",
  "(Bean juice, huh... Could it be a sauce made out of some kind of bean?)": "",
  "Maybe he was referring to honey.": "",
  "Ah, you think he said \"bee juice\" instead? ...Hey, that actually makes sense! Maybe honey's his secret recipe! Boss, you're a genius!": "",
  "He doesn't mean hummus, does he?": "",
  "Ah, I see! Hummus is made from garbanzo beans... I could see how that makes sense!": "",
  "Wouldn't that be kind of strange, though?": "",
  "Yeah... What kind of sushi restaurant serves hummus, anyway...?": "",
  "Maybe he meant wasabi?": "",
  "Don't go too hard on him, now. He is improving!": "",
  "I see! He made a mistake and wanted me to fill up the wasabi tray... Okay, I'm on it, boss!": "",
  "Waaaah! Forgive me!": "",
  "I think he's referring to soy sauce.": "",
  "I'm sorry you always have to cover for me...": "",
  "Interesting... Thanks for breaking it down like that!": "",
  "Moreover, you saved me from the chef's verbal assault. I'm thankful for that more than anything.": "",
  "It's made from fermented soybeans, and since this is a sushi restaurant, I doubt it'd be anything else.": "",
  "Yes. It hasn't even been a year since I started.": "",
  "Still getting the hang of things, huh?": "",
  "I used to live overseas because of my parents. I even went to school there and spoke an entirely different language...": "",
  "Oh, so that's why you haven't learned your way around the sushi bar yet.": "",
  "Mm. That was amazing.": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san! Sorry to do this to you again, but...": "",
  "...What's going on this time?": "",
  "The chef told me to put away the \"sandals.\"": "",
  "Do you know what that could mean?": "",
  "Seriously, why do you keep asking me...": "",
  "(Sandals... What item in a sushi bar would possibly resemble sandals?)": "",
  "I think he's talking about your shoes. Maybe they got too dirty?": "",
  "Oh, I see! It's true, my shoes do get bean juice stains all over them!": "",
  "Maybe he meant used chopsticks? Those are made of wood, sandals are made of wood... I honestly have no idea.": "",
  "Boss, I'm gonna go clean my shoes!": "",
  "Maybe what he meant to say was \"vandals.\" Are there some bad customers he wants you to toss out?": "",
  "Well, that's better than what I was gonna guess! Hahahahaha!": "",
  "Don't worry. He'll get better in time.": "",
  "It's the wooden plates you serve the sushi on.": "",
  "Oh, I see! Even though I've never done that before... there's always a first time for everything! Now whose ass am I kicking!?": "",
  "Aaaaahhh! Dang it! I totally knew that...!": "",
  "When you look at one from the side, it looks like a wooden sandal, right?": "",
  "Ohh, now I get it! So that's why the boss calls it that.": "",
  "All right, boss! I served the green tea and dropped off all the checks!": "",
  "I refilled all the bean juice containers, too! And I made sure all the sandals are washed, dried, and ready to go!": "",
  "Is this the same Uozumi-kun who couldn't tell his shoes from his sandals? You sound a lot more confident now.": "",
  "Ah, Yagami-san. Actually, I ended up taking your advice and started studying a lot harder.": "",
  "Take notes right away and review it before the day is done... Something like that?": "",
  "Yeah. Glad to see it's working.": "",
  "Oh, I know just the thing! So we recently started stocking this really high-grade tuna, right?": "",
  "It's a special, domestically raised species, which means our supply is limited...": "",
  "But I'll tell the chef to bump you up to VIP status, Yagami-san! You can have it whenever you like!": "",
  "No kidding! Then I'll look forward to it!": "",
  "(Domestically raised tuna... Can't wait to try it out!)": "",
  "Hey Uozumi, the customer's about to leave! Aren't you forgetting something?": "",
  "Don't tell me you <font_kind=yakuza_italic>still</font_kind> don't remember!": "",
  "Dumbass! You're supposed to be serving green tea!": "",
  "We serve it at the end to help cleanse the palate from the oil contained in the fish. I told you a thousand times!": "",
  "Is that so... Well, I suppose that's fine. But you're not getting off the hook next time, Uozumi!": "",
  "I can only imagine how hard it is working at a sushi bar. You must have a lot to learn.": "",
  "Yeah, especially 'cause the boss makes up his own weird terminology that's nearly impossible to memorize. You'll see what I mean.": "",
  "Interesting. I guess I'll be seeing you around, then. Name's Yagami, by the way.": "",
  "Nice to meet you, Yagami-san. I'm Kenta Uozumi. And please, don't let my lack of knowledge keep you away from our store.": "",
  "You're fine. And besides, the sushi here is too delicious to keep me away.": "",
  "Yagami-san, thank you again for dining with us today!": "",
  "Well, good luck.": "",
  "Hey, Uozumi! I need the bean juice restocked!": "",
  "Don't tell me... You forgot again?": "",
  "You dimwit, I was asking for <font_kind=yakuza_italic>soy sauce</font_kind>! I call it \"bean juice\" because it's made from fermented soybeans!": "",
  "<font_kind=yakuza_italic>Any</font_kind> human being with a halfway decent IQ would know this!": "",
  "You really think so? Hmph... Well, can't argue with the customer.": "",
  "So this is my first time living in Japan.": "",
  "That's right. I'm not used to hearing any terminology that's different than what I know.": "",
  "That makes a lot of sense.": "",
  "Thanks again for being patient with me. I hope you come by again soon.": "",
  "You knucklehead! I was talking about the sushi plates!": "",
  "I told you it's because they look like wooden sandals from the side!": "",
  "Hmph... Don't see any indication of that whatsoever...": "",
  "Wow, you really know your stuff. Thanks to that, I can avoid getting chewed out... at least for today.": "",
  "Sorry I'm always bugging you... I should know all this by now.": "",
  "You really should stop asking customers for help. Have you ever thought about studying your job?": "",
  "For example, try taking notes on what he tells you and then go home and review it.": "",
  "Gah... You do have a point there. Maybe I've been doing it all wrong...": "",
  "(Hope I wasn't too harsh on the guy.)": "",
  "Hi, I'm Yagami. Are you Ohata-san, by any chance?": "",
  "Yes, that's me. I'm sorry for the sudden request.": "",
  "No problem. I understand that these things are urgent sometimes. What can I do for you?": "",
  "Um... I need you to find my son.": "",
  "Your son is missing? Is he lost, or... kidnapped!?": "",
  "Oh no, nothing of the sort.": "",
  "Uh... Then what are we talking about here?": "",
  "He's playing hide-and-seek, and I'd like you to find him.": "",
  "Wait, what? He's hiding from you?": "",
  "Precisely. My son's name is Ayumu, and he turned six this year. Hide-and-seek is his favorite game right now.": "",
  "I don't mean to be presumptuous, but... maybe you should... find him, then?": "",
  "Oh yes, I agree. But I have to be getting to work right now.": "",
  "Can your wife pitch in or anything?": "",
  "Nah, we divorced three years ago. I'm a single father.": "",
  "Fine... But all the same, is this really something you need to hire a detective for?": "",
  "Well, Ayumu is pretty good actually... It's always a real hassle to find him.": "",
  "Last time, he was hiding in the women's restroom, and I never would have found him.": "",
  "...How did you find him then?": "",
  "Ayumu has a cellphone on him at all times. In case of emergencies, mostly.": "",
  "But he likes to send me pictures as a hint for his hiding places.": "",
  "Usually it's enough to go on, but I really don't have time for this today.": "",
  "A six-year-old sending his father hide-and-seek hints on his cell... Welcome to the future, I guess.": "",
  "Yagami-san, I'm happy to pay your fee for this! 80,000 yen. Will you take the job?": "",
  "Well, I guess a paycheck is a paycheck...": "",
  "Let me just send you the hint I got from Ayumu about where he is!": "",
  "No, thank you! I really have to be getting to work now!": "",
  "(I have to find a kid playing hide-and-seek from his father... This is a new one.)": "",
  "(...Where was this picture taken from?)": "",
  "(I should try going to places that come to mind. Asking around might be good too.)": "",
  "(Based on that picture, Ayumu should be around here somewhere...)": "",
  "(I should search the area.)": "",
  "(Whoa! Is that the kid!? That's pretty dangerous!)": "",
  "(I have to get him down before something awful happens...!)": "",
  "Hey! Are you Ayumu-kun? I've been looking for you!": "",
  "Oh, your dad couldn't make it out today, so he sent me to find you instead!": "",
  "Huh? Dad isn't coming?": "",
  "Hey, it's pretty dangerous up there. Why don't you come down so we can talk?": "",
  "So my dad really isn't coming? I sent him the picture and everything...": "",
  "Yeah, he had some important work to do, buddy.": "",
  "Oh, okay. I understand.": "",
  "Do you want me to help you get home?": "",
  "Nope! I can do it myself.": "",
  "Yeah, I do it all the time. See you later, mister.": "",
  "(He seemed pretty upset that it wasn't his father who found him. Guess I better call Ohata-san.)": "",
  "Hello, this is Yagami.": "",
  "Oh, Yagami-san. Were you able to find Ayumu?": "",
  "Yes, just now.": "",
  "I offered to get him home, but he seemed to know the way just fine, so...": "",
  "I see. That's okay. Boys will be boys!": "",
  "Ayumu is such a handful sometimes. Hahaha.": "",
  "Hey, I'm at work right now, so I'll send your payment digitally.": "",
  "Then I guess that wraps this up. Thank you again!": "",
  "(I can't help but wonder if Ayumu-kun made it home...)": "",
  "(Is he hiding in the locker?)": "",
  "(...Nah. The picture was taken from higher up.)": "",
  "Hmm. It's not like I can get fingerprints or anything.": "",
  "(Is he inside here?)": "",
  "Um. Excuse me, I'm looking for a boy, about 6 years old. Have you seen him?": "",
  "Yes, I did. So he was lost? He was walking toward East Taihei Boulevard.": "",
  "East Taihei Boulevard. Got it. Thank you!": "",
  "Ah, Yagami-san. Sorry to drag you out again.": "",
  "Not at at all. What can I do for you today?": "",
  "Um... I'd like you to find Ayumu again.": "",
  "Hide-and-seek again?": "",
  "I have some important deadlines to hit at work, and I can't play with him right now.": "",
  "I'll pay you more than last time! 100,000 yen!": "",
  "Hey, I don't mind doing the job, but...": "",
  "Oh, thank you very much!": "",
  "No, but Ayumu doesn't seem to be having fun with this. Something's off.": "",
  "He was pretty disheartened last time when I told him you couldn't come.": "",
  "Oh, he's just shy.": "",
  "He really clams up around people he doesn't know.": "",
  "I better get to work, though. I'll forward you the picture Ayumu sent me again.": "",
  "(I don't want to judge a single dad, but I feel bad for Ayumu-kun if this is how it always is...)": "",
  "Yagami-san, this is the picture Ayumu sent me. Thanks again!": "",
  "(He's somewhere up high again. And what's that in the middle?)": "",
  "(Hmm... Does this location look familiar at all...?)": "",
  "(If Ayumu's picture is right, he should be hiding somewhere around here.)": "",
  "(Guess I'll look around.)": "",
  "(There he is! And he's in a dangerous spot again...)": "",
  "(I better talk to him now!)": "",
  "Ayumu-kun, I've been looking for you! And that's dangerous, so why don't you come down!?": "",
  "You? You came again?": "",
  "Yeah buddy, your dad's really busy at work, so I came to find you again!": "",
  "Dad isn't coming again...?": "",
  "Hey, we'll talk after you come down!": "",
  "So Dad's working again, huh?": "",
  "Yeah, he said he's really swamped.": "",
  "Hey, Ayumu-kun?": "",
  "Why do you always hide in places like that? It's dangerous, and you could really get hurt.": ""
 },
 "ref_tm": {
  "Fuck!": "บ้าเอ๊ย!",
  "Y-Yes sir!": "ค-ครับผม!",
  "Don't worry about it.": "ไม่ต้องห่วงหรอก",
  "Oh no, nothing of the sort.": "โอ้ ไม่เลยครับ ไม่มีอะไรแบบนั้นหรอก",
  "Oh, thank you very much!": "โอ้ ขอบคุณมากค่ะ!"
 }
}
